            "review_title": "Review at Makiucha",
            "review_text": "flyguy729\nKuala Lumpur, Wilayah Persekutuan, Malaysia3 contributions\n0\nGreat Malaysian halal fare\nMar 2022\nBeen here many times for the past 1 year im in saigon. Their malaysian fare is as close as you can get to great Malaysian food. Nasi Lemak, rendang, penang ckt are all top notch. The only place in saigon that serves all the malay food in a great manner. It also seems that they are halal so i guess we muslims can enjoy it which is a plus one.\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten March 27, 2022",
